@startuml credit-decision
' The sequence diagram derived from the process: the same people and systems,
' now as participants exchanging messages.
title Credit decision
footer owner: Retail Credit · CRD-101 CRD-104 CRD-105

actor Customer
participant CreditOfficer
participant RiskEngine <<service>>

Customer -> CreditOfficer : submitApplication()
CreditOfficer -> RiskEngine : scoreApplicant()
RiskEngine --> CreditOfficer : score
alt score sufficient
  CreditOfficer -> Customer : approveCredit()
else score insufficient
  CreditOfficer -> Customer : rejectApplication()
end
@enduml
